@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/class-diagram
!theme spacelab

title Example Device Extensions — Proof the Abstraction Generalizes

interface Device {
}
interface DevicePlugin {
}
note right of DevicePlugin
  Device and DevicePlugin are defined in
  04 Device Contract and 05 Device Plugin
  Factory. Shown here only as the contracts
  each extension implements.
end note

package "extension: blauberg-mvhr" {
  class BlaubergMVHRPlugin {}
  class BlaubergMVHR {}
}
note bottom of BlaubergMVHR
  Rich sensor + actuator + alarms device.
  Uses coils, discrete inputs and input
  registers together (see docs/reference/
  modbus/blauberg-mobus-table.md).
end note

package "extension: modbus-temp-sensor" {
  class ModbusTempSensorPlugin {}
  class ModbusTemperatureSensor {}
}
note bottom of ModbusTemperatureSensor
  Pure sensor: DeviceQuery ReadTemperature
  reads a single InputRegisterPoint and
  transforms it via ResponseTransformer
  (see 08 Response Transformers).
end note

package "extension: waveshare-relay" {
  class RelayPlugin {}
  class RelayDevice {}
}
note bottom of RelayDevice
  Pure actuator: DeviceCommand SetRelay(channel, ON/OFF),
  ToggleRelay(channel) and FlashRelayOn(channel, duration)
  all write the same CoilPoint family with different
  vendor-specific payload types (RelayCommand tri-state
  sentinel, Duration) — never a plain boolean. DeviceQuery
  ReadRelayStates reads coils back as Boolean. Proof that
  PointAddress<T>'s generic T absorbs vendor write quirks
  entirely inside adapter: modbus, with zero core changes.
end note

package "extension: waveshare-analog-output" {
  class AnalogOutputPlugin {}
  class AnalogOutputDevice {}
}
note bottom of AnalogOutputDevice
  Pure actuator: DeviceCommand SetChannelOutput(channel,
  level) writes a single HoldingRegisterPoint; DeviceQuery
  ReadChannelOutputs reads them back. Uses only
  HoldingRegisterPoint — never touches CoilPoint.
end note

BlaubergMVHRPlugin ..|> DevicePlugin
BlaubergMVHRPlugin ..> BlaubergMVHR : creates
BlaubergMVHR ..|> Device

ModbusTempSensorPlugin ..|> DevicePlugin
ModbusTempSensorPlugin ..> ModbusTemperatureSensor : creates
ModbusTemperatureSensor ..|> Device

RelayPlugin ..|> DevicePlugin
RelayPlugin ..> RelayDevice : creates
RelayDevice ..|> Device

AnalogOutputPlugin ..|> DevicePlugin
AnalogOutputPlugin ..> AnalogOutputDevice : creates
AnalogOutputDevice ..|> Device

@enduml
